WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.312
For this fictional invoice task, we compare four choices.

00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:05.521
A person can use a checklist.

00:00:05.521 --> 00:00:07.729
An assistant can prepare a draft.

00:00:07.729 --> 00:00:09.937
Fixed automation can apply confirmed rules.

00:00:09.937 --> 00:00:12.513
An agent may choose several permitted steps.

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:17.298
We compare the same input and result, then choose the simplest suitable pattern.

00:00:17.298 --> 00:00:20.610
More autonomy is not evidence of a better fit.
